The CI Plan starts at $99 a month, and is $0 during the beta. You pay for what your organization uses, billed to your card at the end of each month.

Your organization's [usage page](https://cloud.nx.app/go/organization/usage) shows the counts for the month so far, updated once a day. This page lists what each count costs.

## Rates

| Usage           | What is counted                                                                                             | Rate                                                                         |
| --------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| Compute         | Minutes each worker ran, by machine size                                                                    | See [compute](#compute)                                                      |
| Distribution    | Tasks run in a CI run that used two or more [workers](/docs/features/ci-features/distribute-task-execution) | $0.0006 a task, or $0.0008 with dynamic task packing on. $0.50 a run at most |
| Remote cache    | Tasks restored from the [remote cache](/docs/features/ci-features/remote-cache)                             | $0.0001 a task                                                               |
| Ultracache      | Tasks skipped by [Ultracache](/docs/features/ci-features/remote-cache#ultracache)                           | $0.00036 a task                                                              |
| Self-Healing CI | Credits used by [AI fixes](/docs/features/ci-features/self-healing-ci)                                      | $5.50 per 10,000 credits                                                     |

No task is counted twice. Runs and active contributors appear on the usage page but aren't billed.

## Compute

Compute is billed in credits, at $5.50 per 10,000.

| Machine size | Credits a minute | About        |
| ------------ | ---------------- | ------------ |
| Small        | 3.6              | $0.002 a min |
| Medium       | 7.3              | $0.004 a min |
| Large        | 14.5             | $0.008 a min |
| XL           | 29.1             | $0.016 a min |

ARM machines bill at the rate of their size.

## Concurrent workers

Your organization can run 25 workers at once. A worker pack raises that to 50 ($75 a month), 75 ($150) or 100 ($225).

## Estimate your bill

Enter your own numbers in the [pricing calculator](https://nx.dev/pricing/calculator).
